  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f424be585f9e04c79a96c8292e8b9db1, type: 3}
  m_Name: Chefe_ColapsoFiscal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: Crise fiscal das cidades
  _titleEn: City fiscal crises
  _category: 2
  _unlockTrigger: 14
  _summary: "Quando a d\xEDvida e as despesas fixas passam do que a cidade arrecada,
    falta dinheiro para o b\xE1sico: ilumina\xE7\xE3o, sa\xFAde, pol\xEDcia e transporte.
    Cada servi\xE7o que para afasta moradores e empresas, e a arrecada\xE7\xE3o cai
    ainda mais."
  _summaryEn: 'When debt and fixed costs exceed what a city collects, money runs
    short for the basics: lighting, health care, police and transit. Every service
    that stops drives residents and businesses away, and revenue falls even further.'
  _realWorld: "Detroit pediu fal\xEAncia em 18 de julho de 2013, com cerca de 18
    bilh\xF5es de d\xF3lares em d\xEDvidas, a maior fal\xEAncia de uma cidade dos
    Estados Unidos; cerca de 40% dos postes estavam apagados. Em 17 de junho de 2016,
    o estado do Rio de Janeiro decretou calamidade financeira, com sal\xE1rios atrasados
    e emerg\xEAncias de hospitais fechadas."
  _realWorldEn: Detroit filed for bankruptcy on July 18, 2013, with about 18 billion
    dollars in debt, the largest bankruptcy of a US city; about 40% of its streetlights
    were out. On June 17, 2016, Rio de Janeiro state declared a financial emergency,
    with late salaries and closed hospital emergency rooms.
  _tradeOffs: "Cortar gastos equilibra as contas, mas corta justamente os servi\xE7os
    que mant\xEAm a cidade de p\xE9. Pegar empr\xE9stimo ganha tempo, mas os juros
    encarecem tudo depois."
  _tradeOffsEn: Cutting spending balances the books, but it cuts the very services
    that keep the city standing. Borrowing buys time, but the interest makes everything
    more expensive later.
  _sources:
  - Label: 'Michigan Advance, On this day in 2013: the city of Detroit files for
      bankruptcy (2023)'
    Url: https://michiganadvance.com/2023/07/18/on-this-day-in-2013-the-city-of-detroit-files-for-bankruptcy/
  - Label: Fortune, Detroit's bankruptcy is an utter defeat (2013)
    Url: https://fortune.com/2013/07/19/detroits-bankruptcy-is-an-utter-defeat/
  - Label: "Governo do Rio de Janeiro, Decreto n\xBA 45.692, de 17 de junho de 2016"
    Url: https://legislacao.fazenda.rj.gov.br/wcc-migracao/Contribution_Folders/site_fazenda/legislacao/financeira/basica/decretos/2016/DECRETO%20N%c2%ba%2045.692,%20DE%2017%20DE%20JUNHO%20DE%202016.pdf
  - Label: "Brasil de Fato, Decreto de calamidade afetar\xE1 servi\xE7os p\xFAblicos
      no Rio de Janeiro (2016)"
    Url: https://www.brasildefato.com.br/2016/06/22/decreto-de-calamidade-afetara-servicos-publicos-no-rio-de-janeiro/
